  "selector": ".profile",
  "description": "The profile screen: a title bar, a card with your name, phone and address, then groups of rows: Your Therapist, Preferences (with the SMS reminders toggle), Support & Feedback, and Account & Privacy. The bottom nav is on Profile. The title bar and the nav are blurred over the content as it scrolls. Under it, the pages you reach from Profile are states: About (Meet Thoughtful, with About and Legal), Support (and with the call requested), Share feedback and What is Thoughtful?.",
